{"episodes":{"197557":"Multiple hail storms occurred Christmas eve into Christmas Day.","197562":"Strong marine thunderstorms occurred during the early morning on Christmas Day.","198103":"An upper-level trough brought a cold front through South-Central Texas. Thunderstorms developed in the warm sector ahead of the front. Some of these storms produced large hail.","198345":"Thunderstorms developed along a Pacific cold front as it and an upper level trough swept through the Plains on Christmas Eve 2024. The system produce a few severe storms across Central Texas and flash flooding in parts of North Texas. In addition, a brief EF-0 occurred in southwest Freestone County damaging 2 properties.","198893":"A few strong to severe storms along a cold front pushed through early Christmas Day morning over the Victoria Crossroads. A CWOP weather station in Victoria, TX measured a wind gust of 58 mph."},"events":[{"begin":"2024-12-25T00:25Z","county":"Anderson","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-12-25T00:25Z","endLat":31.69,"endLon":-95.45,"episode":198345,"id":1226426,"injuries":0,"lat":31.69,"location":"4.03 SE Kossuth","lon":-95.45,"magnitude":1.75,"narrative":"A public report and photos indicated ping pong to golf ball sized hail.","source":"Public","state":"TX","type":"Hail","wfo":"FWD"},{"begin":"2024-12-25T00:31Z","county":"Bastrop","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-12-25T00:31Z","endLat":30.38,"endLon":-97.33,"episode":198103,"id":1224934,"injuries":0,"lat":30.38,"location":"3.16 NE Elgin","lon":-97.33,"magnitude":1.25,"narrative":"A thunderstorm produced half dollar size hail northeast of Elgin.","source":"Trained Spotter","state":"TX","type":"Hail","wfo":"EWX"},{"begin":"2024-12-25T00:55Z","county":"Burleson","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-12-25T00:55Z","endLat":30.6,"endLon":-96.61,"episode":197557,"id":1222027,"injuries":0,"lat":30.6,"location":"0.59 W Cook